      "versionNonce": 449224308,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785263639653,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Problème du Cold Start",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Problème du Cold Start",
      "index": "b2J",
      "frameId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text_txt_det_c_2_p3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1850,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 87.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 123,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1364177612,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785263639653,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "w1 et w2 sont dynamiques. Au lancement, w1\nest proche de 100% car le graphe Neo4j est\nvide. Plus l'historique s'enrichit, plus w2\naugmente pour affiner la recommandation par\nl'intelligence collective.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "w1 et w2 sont dynamiques. Au lancement, w1\nest proche de 100% car le graphe Neo4j est\nvide. Plus l'historique s'enrichit, plus w2\naugmente pour affiner la recommandation par\nl'intelligence collective.",
      "index": "b2K",
      "frameId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text_expl_moteur",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -462.111328125,
      "y": 406,
      "width": 661.111328125,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 123,
      "version": 736,
      "versionNonce": 1031322131,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785264201765,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(Agit comme un entremetteur : croise le profil de l'acheteur avec le catalogue\npour suggérer la voiture parfaite, même celle à laquelle on n'avait pas pensé)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
